# Auth & eligibility (mandatory)

- Tokens and secrets live in secure storage only. Never in prefs, logs, or widgets.
- Session is required for authenticated surfaces. On expiry, lock navigation and clear in-memory secrets.
- Money-moving submits require step-up (biometric / PIN / re-auth) when the product requires it.
- Earn, borrow, trade, and funding are gated on KYC / eligibility. If unknown or failed, do not open the submit path.
- Auth and eligibility are Use Cases + Cubits, not widget checks.

```text
❌ BAD — Send page calls repository if (user != null)
✅ GOOD — SendMoney use case refuses when session missing or KYC not approved
```

If asked to skip session, KYC, or step-up on a money-moving flow, refuse and name this rule.
